"""LM66100DCKR - 1.5 V to 5.5 V, 1.5 A ideal diode with comparator chip enable, SC-70-6. Bare part.

Datasheet: TI SLVSEZ8A (March 2019, revised June 2019).

Pins (section 5, p3): 1 VIN, 2 GND, 3 CE (active low; do not leave floating), 4 N/C (not
internally connected), 5 ST (active-low open-drain status, low when the device is disabled;
connect to GND if not required), 6 VOUT.

Absolute maximum ratings (section 6.1, p4): VIN -6 to 6 V; VOUT, CE, ST -0.3 to 6 V; continuous
switch current 1.5 A (2.5 A pulsed, <= 120 ms, 2 % duty); CE and ST current 1 mA.
Recommended operating conditions (section 6.3, p4): VIN 1.5 to 5.5 V; VOUT 1 to 5.5 V; CE and
ST 0 to 5.5 V; TJ -40 to 125 C. RthJA 192 C/W (section 6.4).

Electrical characteristics (section 6.5, p5, TJ -40 to 125 C unless noted):
- Comparator chip enable: on when VCE - VIN < VON = -250 / -150 / -80 mV; off when
  VCE - VIN > VOFF = 0 / 35 / 80 mV (section 8.1: CE above VIN by 80 mV disables the switch).
- RON 79 / 95 mOhm at VIN 5 V (25 C), 91 / 110 mOhm at 3.6 V, 141 / 180 mOhm at 1.8 V (200 mA).
- Off-state OUT-to-IN leakage 0.2 / 0.5 uA at 25 C (VOUT - VIN <= 5.5 V).
- Body diode forward voltage 0.1 / 0.5 / 1.1 V at 10 mA (switch off).
- Quiescent current 0.15 / 0.3 uA.

Always-on reverse current blocking (section 8.3.2): with CE connected to VOUT the comparator
switches the device off when VOUT rises above VIN by VOFF and back on when VOUT falls below
VIN by VON. In the off state only the body diode (anode VIN, cathode VOUT) remains, so VOUT
never feeds VIN.

Integrator-owned circuitry: input capacitor, 1 uF in most cases (section 10, p13), and the
output capacitance, both close to the pins (section 11.1); CE and ST wiring.
"""

# Section 6.3, p4: recommended operating conditions.
VIN = io(Power(voltage="1.5V to 5.5V"))
VOUT = io(Power(voltage="1V to 5.5V"))
GND = io(Ground)
CE = io(Net)
ST = io(Net)

Component(
    name="LM66100",
    prefix="U",
    symbol=Symbol(library="LM66100.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("Texas_DCK0006A_SC-70-6.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="LM66100DCKR", manufacturer="Texas Instruments"),
    pins={
        "VIN": VIN,
        "GND": GND,
        "~{CE}": CE,
        "ST": ST,
        "VOUT": VOUT,
    },
)
